1
00:00:00,663 --> 00:00:03,503
(Amy:)Hey. They may conceive a child
on their wedding night.

2
00:00:03,708 --> 00:00:07,298
(Amy:)Don't you think the kid might get a kick
out of knowing how it happened?

3
00:00:07,712 --> 00:00:11,052
l don't care. Ask her things like,
"Are you gonna take Howard's name?"

4
00:00:11,215 --> 00:00:13,385
Not "who's gonna sit on who?"

5
00:00:14,886 --> 00:00:16,886
l've been thinking I'm gonna hyphenate.

6
00:00:17,054 --> 00:00:20,724
Bernadette Maryann
Rostenkowski-Wolowitz.

7
00:00:20,892 --> 00:00:25,232
Nice. You should totally get Bernadette
Maryann Rostenkowski-wolowitz.com...

8
00:00:25,396 --> 00:00:27,856
(Penny:)...before someone snaps it up.

9
00:00:29,066 --> 00:00:31,696
(Bernadette:)Howard already took care of it.

10
00:00:32,361 --> 00:00:35,241
(Bernadette:)He set up our beautiful wedding website
with cute facts...

11
00:00:35,406 --> 00:00:37,036
(Bernadette:)...about our family histories.

12
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:40,990
(Bernadette:)For a while in Poland, my family
and his family were neighbors.

13
00:00:41,162 --> 00:00:45,082
- Oh, that's cool.
- No, it's not. I'll explain it to you later.

14
00:00:50,087 --> 00:00:52,507
(Raj:)May I have your attention, please?

15
00:00:52,715 --> 00:00:57,215
We are here tonight to celebrate
the upcoming nuptials of my best friend...

16
00:00:57,512 --> 00:00:58,592
(Raj:)...Howard Wolowitz.

17
00:00:58,846 --> 00:01:00,636
(Raj:)Hear, hear.

